{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02543","headline":"奉和春日望海 · 许敬宗","name":"奉和春日望海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"韩夷愆奉賮，凭险乱天常。\n乃神弘庙畧，横海剪吞航。\n电野清玄菟，腾笳振白狼。\n连云飞巨舰，编石架浮梁。\n周游临大壑，降望极遐荒。\n桃门通山拚，蓬渚降霓裳。\n惊涛含蜃阙，骇浪掩晨光。\n青丘绚春组，丹谷耀华桑。\n长驱七萃卒，成功百战场。\n俄且旋戎路，饮至肃岩廊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许敬宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02543.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02543","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}